      "en": "for their hearts plot violence and their lips talk about mischief.",
      "ko": "그들의 마음은 강포를 품고 그 입술은 잔해를 말함이니라",
      "source_text_hash": "5a31b846b43e973edf4725d6f616cfa6677b76406670811f642c83461a32bf05",
