      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "PRO",
          "chapter": 24,
          "verse": 3
        }
      ],
      "en": "Through wisdom a house is built; by understanding it is established;",
      "ko": "집은 지혜로 말미암아 건축되고 명철로 말미암아 견고히 되며",
      "source_text_hash": "fac5e70d4a52025e95be2cbcb6a34be93eabd7f9cf024fa9072bb182644f2e5d",
      "translation_text_hash": "269fb1408193ae6df53eca02bee88327246959bdfcbd6654ded997142c126ccf",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "집은 지혜로 말미암아 건축되고 명철로 말미암아 견고히 되며"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "269fb1408193ae6df53eca02bee88327246959bdfcbd6654ded997142c126ccf"
      ]
    },
    {
