        }
      ],
      "en": "A wise man has great power. A knowledgeable man increases strength,",
      "ko": "지혜 있는 자는 강하고 지식 있는 자는 힘을 더하나니",
      "source_text_hash": "cc04113cf940980a18d1aa6c8d80eb4c11fbb51595c5fd804669bae095ac7c92",
      "translation_text_hash": "4a8dc964c94d8c00bf415f6d4aa91ff6087eb6279f86daeb73a19e84bdfb5c7e",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
