      "en": "for by wise guidance you wage your war, and victory is in many advisors.",
      "ko": "너는 모략으로 싸우라 승리는 모사가 많음에 있느니라",
      "source_text_hash": "74dd65e2d5fa0433f7ca237804bc62cf2613039d589e846f960922dee4ff6d42",
      "translation_text_hash": "708f1f6828d20267f0c434d08e0a3dd661aeb28a768c57f28aaa348ac4a16ca8",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
