      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "PRO",
          "chapter": 24,
          "verse": 8
        }
      ],
      "en": "One who plots to do evil will be called a schemer.",
      "ko": "악을 행하기를 꾀하는 자를 일컬어 사특한 자라 하느니라",
      "source_text_hash": "41c342f4d9224d101ea4d61a230e7ed7069da23e43b6fb5f3d55bed66abb49f1",
      "translation_text_hash": "dc0d749f5a22497257e87d957b738bcc4b7a46cedab30b9422e9b800a627216d",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
