        "verse": 11
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "PRO",
          "chapter": 24,
          "verse": 11
        }
      ],
      "en": "Rescue those who are being led away to death! Indeed, hold back those who are staggering to the slaughter!",
      "ko": "너는 사망으로 끌려가는 자를 건져주며 살륙을 당하게 된 자를 구원하지 아니치 말라",
      "source_text_hash": "9145e66ca21398626a0d8ddc628aa3ec25d082e75bb9f2d3e8045df83285bc22",
      "translation_text_hash": "f68c56ef3ed26c33776ac485282501d8ad8787c1e923314724e1d9f57686e6cb",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
